1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,500
[Sunny the Sun yawns over Daisy Dell]

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,500
PIP: Park day! Park day! PARK DAAAY!

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:20,500
MAMA: Stay with your friends, and stay where Papa can see you.

4
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,000
PIP: I will! I'm five-and-a-little-bit!

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
DOT: Pip! Plan!

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
[MAIN TITLE]  Pip Has a Plan!

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,000
PAPA: Morning, park patrol! I'll be right here at the mailbox.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
POPPY: Race you to the willow tree!

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
PIP: You're ON!

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
TUCK: Park rule number one: no running near the... puddles.

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
POPPY: Ha! Winner!

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
PIP: I was going for wettest. I won that one!

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
SKYE: Um... everyone? There's something under the bush.

14
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
PIP: Whoa. It's... it's... what IS it?

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
POPPY: It's a ball! A giant spotty ball! I'm gonna kick it!

16
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:29,000
TUCK: Don't kick it! We don't know what it is!

17
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:36,000
PIP: I'm not scared!

18
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:43,000
TUCK: It's an EGG. A great big egg. Eggs need to stay warm, with their mama.

19
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,000
SKYE: But where's its mama?

20
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:54,000
PIP: Ooh! I have a PLAN! The Super-Speedy Get-the-Egg-Home Plan!

21
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,000
POPPY: Ooh, super-speedy. I like it already.

22
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:15,000
PIP: Eggs live in nests. Nests are near water. So this egg lives at Circle Pond!

23
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:21,000
PIP (V.O.): Step ONE: Pip finds a wagon!

24
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Step TWO: Pip lifts the egg, super gently, onto his cozy scarf!

25
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Step THREE: Pip rolls it to Circle Pond, ZOOM!

26
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:50,000
PIP (V.O.): Step FIVE: the egg is HOME! And the crowd goes WILD!

27
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:55,000
TUCK: Um, Pip? What about step four?

28
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,000
PIP: There IS no step four!

29
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:02,000
TUCK: ...That's what I mean.

30
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:06,500
SKYE: Pip, I saw something next to the egg, it was a--

31
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:10,000
PIP: STEP ONE! Found a wagon!

32
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:16,000
PIP: There. Nice and cozy.

33
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:25,000
PIP: STEP THREE! Roll it to Circle Pond! Super-speedy!

34
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,500
PIP: Uh-oh.

35
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:30,000
EVERYONE: UH-OHHH!

36
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:40,000
PIP: And the wagon is getting away, folks! This is NOT part of the plan!

37
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:48,000
TUCK: Poppy, NO! Spiky plus egg equals BAD!

38
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:55,000
POPPY: Oops! Right! Not spiky! Not spiky!

39
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:02,000
[FWUMP!]

40
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:06,000
PIP: Okay... Plan B.

41
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:10,000
TUCK: Plan B is: we walk. Slowly.

42
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:15,000
PIP: ...Plan B is: we walk slowly.

43
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:22,000
PIP: Step FIVE! Ta-da! We found your egg!

44
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:28,000
DUCK: Oh, sweetie, that's not ours.

45
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:38,000
DUCK: Our eggs are THIS big. That egg is... THAT big.

46
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:45,000
[tap... tap...]

47
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:58,000
PIP: I just wanted to help it get home. And now it's even farther away.

48
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:25,000
SKYE: Pip? I tried to tell you before. I found THIS. It's a feather. A really big one.

49
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:34,000
PIP: Skye. You were trying to tell me the most important step. I'm sorry.

50
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:41,000
PIP: Step four: find out WHOSE egg it is! We have to go back to where we started.

51
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:45,000
TUCK: Back to the green dot.

52
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:54,000
PIP: It's a dotted path! A feather path!

53
00:05:55,500 --> 00:06:10,000
SKYE: I can see it from up here! There's a big nest, and a big white goose!

54
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:22,000
MRS. HONKABY: My egg! Oh, my baby egg!

55
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:29,000
PIP: Wait for it... wait for it...

56
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:33,000
GOSLING: Peep!

57
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:37,000
PIP: He said my NAME!

58
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:41,000
TUCK: Did you know baby geese say peep?

59
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:45,000
EVERYONE: Pip-pip-HOORAY!

60
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:52,000
PIP: Step four... LISTEN to Skye.

61
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:59,000
PIP: See you tomorrow, little buddy!

